    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Wield Destructive Power from Afar</p></blockquote><p>An Artillerist specializes in using magic to hurl energy, projectiles, and explosions across a battlefield.</p><h3>Artillerist Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.Z9tJqLO84wSu18Ls]{Tools of the Trade}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.9Dn78cYN3hCIlxPF]{Eldritch Cannon}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.dCxDONxpdnP1PiyI]{Arcane Firearm}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.hX9lBYWcRPM5Gx8e]{Explosive Cannon}</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.WPrMvKS2gLMHDQ1F]{Fortified Position}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Artillerist Spells</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Artificer Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplShield0000]{Shield}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplThunderwav]{Thunderwave}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplScorchingR]{Scorching Ray}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplShatter000]{Shatter}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplFireball00]{Fireball}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplWindWall00]{Wind Wall}</td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplIceStorm00]{Ice Storm}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplWallofFire]{Wall of Fire}</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplConeofCold]{Cone of Cold}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplWallofForc]{Wall of Force}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
